@startuml
title Partner Management - BIAN Control Record UML
' Machine-readable reconstruction of the raster BIAN Control Record diagram
' Service Domain: Partner Management
' Source image: partner-management-bom-uml.png
' BIAN source: https://bian.org/servicelandscape-14-0-0/views/view_51738.html
' Extraction: raster reconstruction; labels normalized where legible
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

class "Partner Management" as SD <<ServiceDomain>>
class "Partner Relationship Management Plan" as CRT <<ControlRecord>>
class "Management Plan" as GA <<GenericArtifact>>
class "Activity" as BQT <<BehaviorQualifierType>>

class "CR Partner Relationship Management Plan Instance Record" as CRI <<ControlRecordInstance>> {
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Reference : Identifier
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Type : PlanType
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Legal Type : LegalType
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Associated Party : Identifier
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Agreement : Agreement
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Key : Identifier
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Description : Text
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Organization : Organization
  + Partner Relationship Management Plan Budget Value : Amount
}

SD "1" --> "1" CRT : defines control record
CRT "1" --> "0..*" CRI : instantiated as
CRT --> GA : conforms to generic artifact
GA --> BQT : qualified by

note right of CRI
  Source was a low-resolution PNG-only BIAN diagram.
  Text has been normalized for machine-readable context.
end note

@enduml
